  "problem": "Advanced users lacked practical depth for variable meaning, linkage and pricing limitations. Blanket disclaimers could hide maternal/infant and fiscal/calendar distinctions. Guides could recommend CCN=NPI, name-only merging, or inferring observed payments from negotiated-rate files. Current evaluation artifacts and failure scope could remain unnamed.",
